{"id":"n71310-1-13","stage":2,"title":"판매 · 销售","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71310-1-13-1","ko":"너희 아버지께서는 무슨 일을 하시니?","zh":"你们爸爸是做什么工作的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아버지께서는","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"2","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하시니?","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"拥有某种职业或运营某种事业。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d7bf9de381580d798e99.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71310-1-13-2","ko":"보험 판매 일을 하세요.","zh":"他从事保险销售工作。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"보험","meaning":"保险","explanation":"보험：保险","readings":[{"term":"보험","audio":"/audio/483b66ad0cc4f7d5acd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59682","senseId":"1","lemma":"보험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"판매","meaning":"销售","explanation":"판매：销售","readings":[{"term":"판매","audio":"/audio/ee8c398bbe6e22331de3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71310","senseId":"1","lemma":"판매","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하세요.","meaning":"从事，经营","explanation":"하다：从事，经营；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"6","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"483b66ad0cc4f7d5","term":"보험","zh":"保险","audio":"/audio/483b66ad0cc4f7d5acd1.mp3","entryId":"59682","definition":"为在未来发生灾害或疾病等时得到金钱上的补偿而在规定的时间内缴纳一定金额的钱进行积累的制度。","pronunciation":["보ː험"]},{"id":"ee8c398bbe6e2233","term":"판매","zh":"销售","audio":"/audio/ee8c398bbe6e22331de3.mp3","entryId":"71310","definition":"出售商品。","pronunciation":["판매"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"从事，经营","audio":"/audio/